___getX4SqlSearchDALEG0: [B-11] [n,el]
SQL:
select *                                  
 ,x1 as En,dx1 as dEn                     
 ,y as Sig,dy as dSig                     
from uni1                                 
where                                     
 (SF58 like ',DA,,LEG')                   
 and x2=0                                 
 and Target like 'B-11'             
 and Reaction like 'n,el'            
order by fullCode,YearRef1 desc,DatasetID 
 ,En,iPoint                               


EXFOR SQL executed.

